<title>FRANCE: Frattini new Air France U.S. cargo vp.</title>
<headline>Frattini new Air France U.S. cargo vp.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France said it has named Bernard Frattini as vice-president cargo for North America and French Polynesia, succeeding Daniel Peudupin who has returned to the airline's Paris headquarters.</p>
<p>Frattini, has been with Air France Cargo since 1978, moving through several managerial jobs including manager of worldwide cargo capacity control. His most recent post was general manager for Air France Cargo in the UK and Ireland. -Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
